<title>THAILAND: Thai Farmers Bank raises deposit rates.</title>
<headline>Thai Farmers Bank raises deposit rates.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thai Farmers Bank, one of Thailand's biggest commercial banks, on Tuesday raised its deposit rates to 10.50-11.75 percent from 8.00-9.25 percent previously, a company official said.</p>
</text>
